## PER TASK

**1 · Take** — `gh issue list --label %%queue_label%% --label P1 --state open`, then P2,
lowest number first.%%queue_filters%% None → stop. View it + comments — a `rejected:`
comment is the spec now. Claim: add `in-progress`.

**2-3 · Orient, verify** — Read CLAUDE.md, %%architecture_doc%%, VISION (first task),
the initiative if `Part of #<i>`. Reuse search: grep the routes/models/components/
helpers it touches. Confirm the described problem exists in committed, deployed code —
"fixed locally" isn't fixed. Already shipped → `already-fixed: <where, SHA>`, next task.

**4 · Design note** — Comment on the issue: approach, files, data changes, reuse,
considered-and-rejected, tests planned, risks. %%plan_notes%% Dispatch `architect` when
required; address every BLOCKING point, take-or-refute SHOULD in one line.
Too big for one session → ship the first working slice, file the remainder as a new
task with the same `Part of #<i>`/`Size`, comment the split. Never leave a half-built
slice merged.

**5 · Branch** — %%branch_setup%%

**6 · Implement** — Test first where the code allows: failing test → minimal code →
refactor while green. Stay inside the design note; update it if reality forces a
change. %%style_rules%%

**7 · Verify yourself** — Build/typecheck/lint clean. Full suite green.
%%regression_check%% Exercise every AC live (%%evidence_method%%); interaction changes
repeated rapidly, varied order.

**8 · Code review** — Dispatch `reviewer`: issue number, design note, AC, diff range.
Fix every BLOCKING and every SHOULD you can't refute in one line; re-run step 7. Second
`reviewer` round only if the fixes were substantial. Keep the final verdict for the PR.

%%ship_gate%%

**9 · Ship** — %%ship_deploy%% PR body: `Ref #<n>`, what changed, tests added, reviewer
verdict.

**10 · Docs** — New module/helper/pattern/entity → update %%architecture_doc%% in the
same PR. New hard invariant or command → one line in CLAUDE.md. Nothing else.

**11 · Done** — Comment: shipped (what, PR, deploy) / tests / review verdict /
deviations (none, or what+why). %%extra_done_fields%% Relabel `ready-for-review`. Return
the clone to the default branch. Next task.

